message: >-
  Cite the Lonta report for its original comparisons and figures, and separately
  cite Census/HUD and the DataLumos archival edition for the underlying survey.
  See CITATION.md for definitions, rights and Codex disclosure.
title: "Lonta Home-Service Demand Study: reproducible analysis source"
type: software
