license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Company-authored, Codex-assisted secondary analysis of the 2023 American
  Housing Survey using DataLumos 217661/V2. This repository contains original
  analysis code, masked aggregate exports and figures, without raw survey rows.
  Original Lonta aggregates, figures, commentary and worksheets are CC BY 4.0;
  the underlying survey retains separate rights and access terms. This is not
  peer-reviewed research, client observations or a causal advertising study.
